## Room Types
▸ **Standard Capsule** — compact, 1-2 guests, budget-friendly
▸ **Zero-G Pod** — single occupancy, weightless sleep experience
▸ **Crater View Deluxe** — panoramic viewport, 2-3 guests
▸ **Panoramic Suite** — wide-view dome, 2-3 guests, premium comfort
▸ **Nebula Penthouse** — top-tier multi-room suite, up to 4 guests, 270° observation dome

## Gravity Settings
▸ Zero-G — full weightlessness, harness provided
▸ Lunar (0.16g) — gentle low-gravity, great for first-timers
▸ Mars (0.38g) — moderate gravity, comfortable for longer stays
▸ Earth Standard (1g) — familiar gravity for those who prefer it

## Amenities Available
▸ Zero-G Spa — wellness in weightlessness
▸ Asteroid Observation Deck — free at most hotels
▸ Plasma Pool — heated zero-g water experience
▸ Holodeck Suite — immersive simulation environments
▸ Spacewalk Tour — guided EVA, requires basic certification
▸ Nebula Dining — fine dining with a view of the cosmos
▸ Cryo Sleep Chamber — optional deep-rest experience

